    "long_instructions": "### Student Budgeter\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Review the example:** Look at the completed button. Notice how the function is written as a named arrow function and how it is connected using `addEventListener`.\r\n\r\n2. Read a function description for another button in `prompt.md`.\r\n\r\n3. Highlight the button description, select **Add to AI Tutor Chat**, and ask the AI to write a named arrow function that matches the description.\r\n\r\n4. Create an event handler using `addEventListener(\"click\", functionName)` and add your function.\r\n\r\n5. Click the button and confirm that it works as expected.\r\n\r\n6. Complete the same steps for the remaining buttons.",
    "display_name": "Student Budgeter",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>Student Budgeter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Student Budgeter</h1>\n  <p>Track a total and update it with buttons.</p>\n\n  <h2>Total</h2>\n  <p id=\"totalDisplay\">$0</p>\n\n  <p id=\"output\">Ready.</p>\n\n  <h2>Actions</h2>\n  <button id=\"addFiveButton\">Add $5</button>\n  <button id=\"addTwelveButton\">Add $12</button>\n  <button id=\"taxButton\">Add Tax</button>\n  <button id=\"discountButton\">Add Discount</button>\n  <button id=\"resetButton\">Reset</button>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  background: #f5f7ff;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 24px 12px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 10px 0;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n#totalDisplay {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n#output {\n  margin: 16px auto;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  min-height: 30px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fbfdff;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 6px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n}\n\n#addFiveButton {\n  background: #dbeafe;\n  border-color: #93c5fd;\n  color: #1e3a8a;\n}\n\n#addTwelveButton {\n  background: #e9d5ff;\n  border-color: #c084fc;\n  color: #6b21a8;\n}\n\n#taxButton {\n  background: #fde68a;\n  border-color: #fcd34d;\n  color: #92400e;\n}\n\n#discountButton {\n  background: #dcfce7;\n  border-color: #86efac;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n#resetButton {\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n  border-color: #d1d5db;\n  color: #374151;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const addFiveButton = document.getElementById(\"addFiveButton\");\n\nconst totalDisplay = document.getElementById(\"totalDisplay\");\nconst output = document.getElementById(\"output\");\n\nlet total = 0;\n\nconst addFive = () => {\n  total = total + 5;\n  totalDisplay.textContent = \"$\" + total;\n  output.textContent = \"Added $5.\";\n};\n\naddFiveButton.addEventListener(\"click\", addFive);",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "prompt.md",
          "contents": "## Add $5 Button\nName of Button: Add $5\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: increase the total by 5\nWhat on the page changes: the total number and the message\n\n## Add $12 Button\nName of Button: Add $12\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: increase the total by 12\nWhat on the page changes: the total number and the message\n\n## Tax Button\nName of Button: Add Tax\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: increase the total by 7\nWhat on the page changes: the total number and the message\n\n## Discount Button\nName of Button: Add Discount\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: decrease the total by 10\nWhat on the page changes: the total number and the message\n\n## Reset Button\nName of Button: Reset\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: reset the total to 0\nWhat on the page changes: the total number and the message",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
    },
